E°_cell = standard cell potential
R = gas constant (8.314 J/mol·K)
T = temperature (298 K)
n = number of electrons transferred in the redox reaction (2 for this case, as Cu²⁺ + 2e⁻ → Cu and 2H⁺ + 2e⁻ → H₂)
F = Faraday's constant (96485 C/mol)
Q = reaction quotient

