   \[
   E_{\text{wave}} = 0.7 \times 1.1 \text{ kJ} = 0.7 \text{ kJ} = 700 \text{ J}
   \]  

5. **Calculate the grams of TNT required**:  
   The energy per gram of TNT is 4680 J/g.  
   \[
   \text{grams of TNT} = \frac{700 \text{ J}}{4680 \text{ J/g}} = 0.159 \text{ g}
